{"step_index":1054,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T22:04:57Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Summary of the comprehensive 5treesfellowship.church design system overhaul and code optimizations across SnapDialer.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# SnapDialer Design System Overhaul & UI/UX Elevation\n\nWe have systematically transformed the entire visual interface, color palette, typography hierarchy, and UI architecture of **SnapDialer** to align with the design standards of **[5treesfellowship.church](https://5treesfellowship.church)**.\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 5 Trees Fellowship Design System & Palette\n\nThe application now uses a dedicated design token architecture defined in [`src/theme/colors.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/theme/colors.ts):\n\n| Design Token | Hex / Value | Semantic Role |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Sacred Green Deep** | `#14291B` | Immersive full-screen background & canvas |\n| **Sacred Forest Green** | `#244931` | Primary brand headers, active cards, and CTA accents |\n| **Heavenly Gold** | `#D4AF37` | Core luminous accents, primary action buttons, key metrics |\n| **Living White** | `#FCFCFA` | High-legibility primary typography and icons |\n| **Deep Sky Blue** | `#0077BE` | Secondary actionable badges, timing indicators, text triggers |\n| **Warm Earth Brown** | `#56413B` | Subtle tonal dividers and grounding contours |\n| **Card / Surface Layer**| `#1A3624` | Elevated touch target cards with border `#264A32` |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Screen-by-Screen UI/UX Transformations\n\n1. **Master Pipeline ([`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **Header & Branding**: Radiant Heavenly Gold (`#D4AF37`) app branding with crisp `#FCFCFA` typography.\n   - **KPI Strip**: Four-pillar metrics card in Sacred Green (`#1A3624`) with glowing stats.\n   - **1-Tap Power Dialer CTA**: Sacred Green container framed with Heavenly Gold glowing borders and a dedicated gold dial icon pill.\n   - **Filter Tabs**: Fluid horizontal scroll chips with active states in Heavenly Gold (`#D4AF37`) and deep emerald dark text.\n   - **Educator Cards**: Polished cards with meeting preference tags, planning period clocks, and direct 1-tap call & AI SMS buttons.\n\n2. **Report Card Photo Scanner ([`ScanSheetScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **Capture Area**: Radiant gold camera action trigger with fallback offline clipboard parsing.\n   - **Auto-Loaded API Keys**: Automatically syncs the user's Gemini key on mount.\n   - **Verification Form**: High-contrast input fields on deep background `#0E1D13` with gold section headers.\n\n3. **Power Dialer HUD ([`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **Cockpit Layout**: Deep Sacred Green stage with swipe gesture indicator in Heavenly Gold.\n   - **Big Dial Trigger**: High-contrast gold dial button with live call timer badge.\n   - **1-Tap Dispositions**: Color-coded action grid (Sit-Down Set in Emerald/Gold, Callback in Amber, No Answer in Slate-Moss, Block/DNC in Crimson).\n\n4. **Educator Profile & Call History ([`LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **Profile Card**: Comprehensive FRS service years, checked questions, and meeting availability in branded cards.\n   - **AI SMS Composer**: Interactive modal with tone chips and direct native SMS messaging.\n\n5. **Backup, Recovery & Settings ([`SettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx)):**\n   - Branded cards for API management, backup exports (Files, iCloud, Google Drive, OneDrive, Email), clipboard copying, and file restores.\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Live Production Deployment\n\n- **Live URL**: [https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)\n- **PWA Configuration**: Injected `theme-color: #244931`, standalone iOS mobile headers, and custom web manifest.\n","Description":"Create walkthrough documenting 5 Trees Fellowship brand redesign","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"Create walkthrough artifact"}}]}
