{"step_index":1056,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T22:05:03Z","content":"The entire SnapDialer application has been transformed to align with the visual identity and color palette of **[5treesfellowship.church](https://5treesfellowship.church)**, incorporating world-class mobile UI/UX practices.\n\n### 🎨 5 Trees Fellowship Design System Integration\n- **Sacred Green Deep (`#14291B`) & Sacred Forest Green (`#244931`)**: Immersive backgrounds, app headers, and primary card layers.\n- **Heavenly Gold (`#D4AF37`)**: Radiant luminous accents, active tab indicators, primary action triggers, and KPI metric highlights.\n- **Living White (`#FCFCFA`) & Warm Earth Accents (`#56413B`)**: Crisp typography and tonal contours.\n- **Deep Sky Blue (`#0077BE`)**: Secondary action indicators and SMS messaging chips.\n- **Centralized Design Tokens**: Defined in [`src/theme/colors.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/theme/colors.ts) across every screen and component.\n\n---\n\n### 📱 Screen Overhauls\n1. **Master Dialing Pipeline ([`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx))**: Rebuilt with Sacred Green cards, Heavenly Gold badges, fluid filter tabs, and a high-converting 1-tap power dialing launcher.\n2. **Report Card Scanner ([`ScanSheetScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx))**: Redesigned camera trigger with automatic Gemini key detection and clean verification forms.\n3. **Power Dialer HUD ([`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx))**: Optimized calling cockpit with glowing dial CTA, swipe gesture indicator, and 1-tap disposition buttons.\n4. **Educator Profile ([`LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx))**: Clear typography, FRS years breakdown, and AI SMS composer.\n5. **Settings & Multi-Source Cloud Backup ([`SettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx))**: Consistent cards for export/import to Google Drive, iCloud, OneDrive, and local files.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Live Deployment\nThe production bundle has been compiled and deployed live:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**\n\nFor details, view the [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/brain/9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3/walkthrough.md) artifact."}
